<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Piyɛri Fɔlɔ</para>
  <para style="toc2">1PI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Piyɛri Fɔlɔ</para>
  <para style="mt1">Piyɛri</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1" />Nde Piyɛri, Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na talibidenba, nde le ɲin sɛbɛla Alla la mɔɔ suwandininilu ma, mɛnilu lajɛnsɛnni londanya rɔ Pɔnti ni Kalati ni Kapadɔsi ni Asi a ni Bitini jamanailu rɔ. <verse eid="1PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2" />Ai suwandinin le ikomin An Fa Alla hankili tɛrɛ a ma ɲa mɛn ma. A ra ai lasɛninya a la Nii Sɛniman baraka rɔ kosa ai ye kolo Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin ma, a jeli ye sadisadi ai ma ai lasɛninya kɔrɔ. Alla ye sɔlini ni jususuma sabati ai rɔ!<verse eid="1PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Habadan jii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3" />Tando ye kɛ an na Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na Fa a ni Alla yɛ. A ra a kɛ a la kininkinin ba rɔ, ka an kɔsɛ, ka sɔrɔn kokura, ka don niilakisi jii rɔ Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin nawuli fɛ mɛn bɔnin saya rɔ. <verse eid="1PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4" />Cɛ mɛn tɛ tiɲanna, a tɛ kɔrikɔrila, a tɛ tununna ka tamin, wo le lamarani ai yɛ harijeene, <verse eid="1PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5" />ai le mɛnilu kandannin a fanka la lemɛniya fɛ kosa ai ye kisi sɔrɔn, mɛn ye bɔla kɛnɛma waati labanilu rɔ.<verse eid="1PE 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6" />Wo rɔ, ai ye sɛwa, hali ai tɔrɔni ai kɔrɔbɔ ko su bɛɛ rɔ waatinin ɲin dɔ <verse eid="1PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7" />kosa ai la lemɛniya ye lasɛnsɛn. Hali sanin mɛn di se tiɲanna, wo ye yelenna ta le la, ka lasɛnsɛn. Wo rɔ, ai la lemɛniya mɛn tɔnɔ ka bon sanin di, wo fanan ka kan ka lasɛnsɛn kɔrɔbɔli rɔ, ka tandoli ni gbiliya ni kunnafulen sɔrɔn Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin di bɔ waati rɔ kɛnɛma. <verse eid="1PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8" />Ai ma Maari yen fɔlɔ kɔni ai ra a kanin. Ai tɛ a yenna sisɛn, kɔni ai ye ai lemɛniyala a ma, ai ye sɛwa ba rɔ mɛn ti se ɲafɔla. <verse eid="1PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9" />Ka a masɔrɔn ai ye ai lemɛniya kun sɔrɔnna, mɛn kɛni ai sɔnɔmɛ kisi ko ri.<verse eid="1PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10" />Keladen fisamante mɛnilu ka sɔlini ko fɔ, mɛn tɛrɛ latɛɛni ai ma, mɛn kɛni kisi ko ri, wo ra kɛ woilu la ko ɲaɲinin ni ko fɛsɛfɛsɛ kun di. <verse eid="1PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11" />Ii tɛrɛ ye karanna waatiilu ni kɛɲailu lɔn kɔrɔ, Ɲenematɔmɔnin na Nii tɛrɛ ye mɛnilu lɛnkɛnɛmayala ii yɛ, baa a tɛrɛ ye ii rɔ, ka Ɲenematɔmɔnin na tɔrɔya ni a la gbiliya natɔla la ko fɔ sani a waati ye se. <verse eid="1PE 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12" />Alla ka a yiraka le kelalaselailu la, ko ii tɛrɛ tɛ baarala ii jɛrɛ yɛ kɔni ai le, ii tɛrɛ ye koilu fɔla ai ka mɛnilu la ko lamɛn wo mɔɔilu la mɛnilu ka Kibaro Ɲuma lase ai ma Nii Sɛniman baraka rɔ mɛn bɔni harijeene. Hali mɛlɛkailu fanan kunfannin wo ko fɛsɛfɛsɛ kɔrɔ.<verse eid="1PE 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">An ye to Alla la Nii Sɛniman dɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13" />Wo le rɔ, ai ye ai hankili rabɛn baara la ko rɔ, ka ai jɛrɛ mira, ka ai jii la wo sɔli rɔ ai ye mɛn sɔrɔnna Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin di bɔ waati rɔ kɛnɛma. <verse eid="1PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14" />Ai ye to ikomin Alla den koloniilu, ai kana sɔn tola ai la kunfan juuilu rɔ, ai tɛrɛ ye mɛnilu rɔ ai la hankilidɔɔya rɔ. <verse eid="1PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15" />Kɔni ikomin Alla sɛniman da aile kili, aile fanan ye sɛninya ai kɛwaliilu bɛɛ rɔ. <verse eid="1PE 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16" />Ka a masɔrɔn a sɛbɛni, «Ai ye sɛninya, ka a masɔrɔn nde sɛniman.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1.16</char> Sarakalaselailu suran 19 kuma diya 2</note>»<verse eid="1PE 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17" />Baa ai ye ai Fa Alla matarala, mɛn ye mɔɔilu bɛɛ kɛwaliilu makitila ɲa kelen ma, ai ye to ikomin londanilu dunuɲa ɲin dɔ, ka kolo Alla ma. <verse eid="1PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18" />Ai ka a lɔn ko ai ma kunka ai failu la namun ko fuuilu ma, fen tiɲan tailu la ikomin wodi wala sanin, <verse eid="1PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19" />kɔni ai kunkani Ɲenematɔmɔnin jeli fisamantɛ le la, mɛn bɔni sarakaya la ikomin saa bulan, fɛɛ tɛ mɛn na a ni mɛn ɲatɛɛni tɛ. <verse eid="1PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20" />Alla tɛrɛ ra wo suwandi sani dunuɲa ye dan, ka a labɔ kɛnɛma ai le la ko rɔ waati laban ɲinilu rɔ. <verse eid="1PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21" />Ai lemɛniyani Alla ma ale le baraka rɔ, Alla mɛn ka a lawuli saya rɔ, a ka gbiliya di wo ma, kosa ai la lemɛniya ni jii ye to Alla rɔ.<verse eid="1PE 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22" />Baa ai ra ai jɛrɛ nii ladahaya tuɲa mira fɛ, ka kaninteya bɛrɛ sɔrɔn ai badenmailu yɛ, wo rɔ, ai ye ai ɲɔɔn kanin ai fanka bɛɛ la, ai sɔnɔmɛ dahanin dɔ. <verse eid="1PE 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23" />Ka a masɔrɔn ai ra ai kɔsɛ, ka sɔrɔn kuraya fanan, mɛn ma fara adamaden na mɛn ye faala, kɔni ka fara Alla la kuma la mɛn ye niila, a ri to habadan. <verse eid="1PE 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24" />Baa a sɛbɛnin Kitabu kɔndɔ ko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:24">«Adamadenilu bɛɛ kɛnin de</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:24">ikomin bin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:24">ii la gbiliya bɛɛ kɛnin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:24">ikomin fen fere.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:24">Binilu ye jala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:24">ii fereilu ye burunna.<verse eid="1PE 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25" />Kɔni Maari la kuma ye tola le habadan.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1.25</char> Esayi suran 40 kuma diya 6 haan 8</note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 1:25">Wo kuma kɛnin Isa la Kibaro Ɲuma le ri mɛn naseni ai ma.<verse eid="1PE 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2" />
  <para style="s">Jama sɛniman</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1" />Wo rɔ, ai fara kojuu su bɛɛ la a ni janfanteya ni filanfilanteya ni minlɛ ni kuma juu bɛɛ. <verse eid="1PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2" />Nii balo bɛrɛ lɔɔ ye ai mira ikomin sin lɔɔ ye den ɲɛrɛn mirala ɲa mɛn ma, kosa ai fanan ye sabati ai kisi ko rɔ a fɛ, <verse eid="1PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3" />baa ai ra a ragbɛ, ka a lɔn ko Maari ka ɲin.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">2.3</char> Yaburi suran 34 kuma diya 9</note><verse eid="1PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4" />Ai ye ai madon a la, mɛn kɛnin siimaya kabakudun di, adamadenilu ka ii ban mɛn dɔ, kɔni Alla ka mɛn suwandi, mɛn dagbɛlɛnyanin a bolo fanan. <verse eid="1PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5" />Aile fanan da kɛ Alla la bon lɔ fenilu ri ikomin siimaya kabakudunilu, ka kɛ sarakalasela jama sɛniman di, ka siimaya sarakailu bɔ Alla sɔnni mɛnilu rɔ ka fara Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na. <verse eid="1PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6" />Ka a masɔrɔn Kitabu ka ɲin de fɔ ko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:6">«A ragbɛ! N da kaba do sii Siyon so kɔndɔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:6">ikomin bon tonkon kaba ɲuma keɲi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:6">Mɛn wa lemɛniya a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:6">maloya ti se wo tii ma.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">2.6</char> Esayi suran 28 kuma diya 16</note><verse eid="1PE 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7" />Kaba ɲin dagbɛlɛnyani aile lemɛniya mɔɔilu le yɛ, kɔni Kitabu yɔrɔ ɲin de bɛnnin lemɛniyabaliilu ma ko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:7">«Bon lɔlailu ka ii ban kabakudun mɛn dɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:7">wo ra kɛ bon jusii kabakudun di.»<verse eid="1PE 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8" />A sɛbɛni Kitabu kɔndɔ fanan ko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:8">«Jama ye ii sennatula kaba mɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:8">ka kɛ ii labe kaba ri.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">2.8</char> A ragbɛ Yaburi suran 118 kuma diya 22 a ni Esayi suran 8 kuma diya 14 kɔndɔ.</note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 2:8">Ii ri ii sennatu a la ka a masɔrɔn ii ma sɔn kuma mirala, baa wo le tɛrɛ natɛɛni ii ma. <verse eid="1PE 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9" />Kɔni aile ra kɛ siya suwandinin di. Mansailu la sarakalaselailu le aile ri, siya sɛniman, Alla ta ye jama mɛn di, kosa ai ye a la baara ɲuma bailu la ko lase, ale mɛn ka ai kili, ka ai bɔ dibi rɔ, ka wa a la kabannako kɛnɛya rɔ. <verse eid="1PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10" />Fɔlɔman, Alla la jama tɛrɛ tɛ ai ri kɔni sisɛn, ai ra kɛ a la jama ri. Aile mɛn tɛrɛ ma Alla la kininkinin sɔrɔn, kɔni sisɛn, ai ra a la kininkinin sɔrɔn.<verse eid="1PE 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lemɛniya mɔɔilu ye kolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11" />Nba, n kaninteilu, ai le mɛnilu kɛnin ikomin londanilu ni taamalailu dunuɲa rɔ, n ye ai madiyala, ai ye ai jɛrɛ mira faribanku kunfan koilu ma mɛnilu ye ai nii kɛlɛla. <verse eid="1PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12" />Ai kɛwaliilu ye ɲumaya lemɛniyabaliilu tɛma, kosa, ii wa ai makuma kojuu kɛla, ii ye ai kɛwali ɲumailu yen, ka Alla gbiliya ɲa lon.<verse eid="1PE 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13" />Ai ye kolo adamadenya mansayailu bɛɛ kɔrɔ Maari la ko kosɔn, a wa kɛ mansa ba ri <verse eid="1PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14" />wala jamanatiilu, a ka mɛnilu lawa baara koronilu sara diya kojuu kɛlailu la, ka koɲuma kɛlailu tando ii la baara ɲumailu la. <verse eid="1PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15" />Ka a masɔrɔn Alla sawo le wo ri, ko ai la koɲuma kɛ ye hankilidɔɔilu da mira ii la hankilidɔɔya rɔ. <verse eid="1PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16" />Ai ye kɛ mɔɔ hɔrɔniilu ri, kɔni ai kana ai la hɔrɔya kɛ kojuu dokon fen di, ai ye kɛ Alla la jɔn ɲumailu ri. <verse eid="1PE 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17" />Ai ye mɔɔ bɛɛ gbiliya, ka ai lemɛniyamɔɔ ɲɔɔilu kanin, ka silan Alla ɲɛrɔ, ka mansacɛ gbiliya.<verse eid="1PE 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa la tɔrɔyailu misali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18" />Jɔnilu, ai ye kolo ai tiilu ma gbiliya ko bɛɛ rɔ, ka tii juuilu kolo ikomin tii ɲuma ni sabariniilu. <verse eid="1PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19" />Ka a masɔrɔn, wo kɛni koɲuma le ri, ni mɔɔ lemɛniya ra ɲakankatan kɔrɔ Alla lɔn na ko rɔ, ka a sɔrɔn wo ɲakankatan bɛnnin tɛ a kɛwaliilu ma. <verse eid="1PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20" />Kɔni wo ri kɛ gbiliya ri ai yɛ di, ni ai ɲakankatanra ai la hakɛ la ko rɔ, ka tunadiya? Adon, ni ai tɔrɔra ai kɛwali ɲumailu la ko rɔ, ka lemɛniya, koɲuma le wo ri Alla ɲakɔrɔ. <verse eid="1PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21" />Alla ka ai kili wo le ma, baa Ɲenematɔmɔnin jɛrɛ tɔrɔra le ai yɛ, ka misali to ai bolo kosa ai ye bila a kɔfɛ. <verse eid="1PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22" />«A ma julumun si kɛ, a ma janfa kuma si fɔ fanan.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">2.22</char> Esayi suran 53 kuma diya 9</note><verse eid="1PE 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23" />Ii ka a nani waati mɛn na, ale ma nanili kɛ. A tɔrɔra waati mɛn na, a ma jaman ii ma kɔni ka a jɛrɛ to kitilala telenni Alla le bolo.<verse eid="1PE 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24" />Isa jɛrɛ ra an julumunilu donin ta a faribanku rɔ, a gbɔngbɔnni jiri kan, kosa an ye kɛ ikomin mɔɔ mɛn farani julumun dɔ, ka to an nii la telen dɔ. Ai ka kɛndɛya sɔrɔn a la madiminniilu le fɛ. <verse eid="1PE 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25" />Ai tɛrɛ kɛni le ikomin saa mɛnilu tununni, kɔni sisɛn ai ra kɔsɛ fanan kolofen gbɛngbɛnna a ni nii kandanna tɔrɔfɛ.<verse eid="1PE 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3" />
  <para style="s">Musoilu ni ii cɛɛilu ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1" />Aile musoilu, ai ye kolo ai cɛɛilu ma, kosa ni ii le doilu lani tɛ Alla la kuma la, ii ye kɛ lemɛniya mɔɔilu ri, ka fara ii musoilu tamanɲa la, hali kuma tɛ, <verse eid="1PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2" />ii wa ai tamanɲa lakɔrɔsi waati mɛn na ai ye sɛninya ni gbiliya mɛn dɔ. <verse eid="1PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3" />Ai la kenɲa kana fara ai masidi ɲa si la, ikomin ka ai kun dan, wala ka sanin don wala ka faanin dagbɛlɛnilu don, <verse eid="1PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4" />kɔni ai jusu rɔ ko ye ɲumaya mɛn dokonni, a tɛ kɔrɔyala, a ye kɛ nii masumani ni nii sabarini le ri, Alla ri mɛn jate haan! <verse eid="1PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5" />Wo le tɛrɛ kɛni a fɔlɔ muso sɛnimanilu lakeɲa fen di, mɛnilu jii lani tɛrɛ Alla rɔ. Ii koloni tɛrɛ ii la cɛɛilu ma <verse eid="1PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6" />ikomin Iburahima la muso Saran tɛrɛ koloni a ma ɲa mɛn ma, a tɛrɛ ye a kilila le ko, «N tii.» Wo denmusoilu le ai ri, ni ai ka koɲuma kɛ, ai tɛ silanna foyi ɲɛrɔ.<verse eid="1PE 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7" />Aile cɛɛilu fanan ye wo ɲa le ma, ai ye a kɛ hankili la ai ni ai muso wa kɛ ai la dunuɲaratɛɛ kɛla ai ɲɔɔn fɛ, ka ii gbiliya baa ii faribanku fanka ma se ai ta rɔ, baa ai ni woilu bɛɛ ri nii lakisi sɔlini sɔrɔn ai cɛyala. Wo rɔ, foyi tɛ ai la Alla matara lalɔ.<verse eid="1PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tɔrɔya telen dɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8" />Nba, aile bɛɛ ye to hankili kelen dɔ, ka kininkinin, ka ai ɲɔɔn kanin badenmaya la, ka ɲumaya ai ɲɔɔn na, ka ai jɛrɛ majii. <verse eid="1PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9" />Ai kana kojuu sara kojuu la, ka nanili sara nanili la, kɔni ai ye duwawu kɛ, ka a masɔrɔn Alla ka ai kili wo le ma kosa ai ye baraka sɔrɔn ai cɛɛya la. <verse eid="1PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10" />Baa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:10">«Siimaya duman mɛn yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:10">mɛn ye siimaya ɲuma fɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:10">wo tii ye a nɛn mira kuma juuilu ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:10">ka a da mira wuya ma,<verse eid="1PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11" />ka a kɔnkɔ don kojuu la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:11">ka koɲuma kɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:11">ka jususuma ɲinin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:11">ka bila a kɔfɛ.<verse eid="1PE 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12" />Maari ɲa ye mɔɔ telenniilu la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:12">a tolo malɔni ii la matarali kan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:12">Kɔni Maari kɔnkɔ donni kojuu kɛlailu la.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">3.12</char> Yaburi suran 34 kuma diya 13 haan 17</note><verse eid="1PE 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13" />Ni koɲuma kunfan ye ai la, yon di se kojuu kɛla ai la? <verse eid="1PE 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14" />Kɔni hali ni ai wa tɔrɔ ai la baara ɲumailu la ko rɔ, sɛwa le wo ri ai yɛ. Ii ye silanna mɛn ɲɛrɔ, ai kana silan wo ɲɛrɔ, ai kana kɔndafili. <verse eid="1PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15" />Kɔni ai ye Ɲenematɔmɔnin gbiliya ai Maari ri ai jusu rɔ. Ai ye to rabɛnni ai kun mafɔ ko la ka bɛn ai jii ma, ii wa ai maɲininka waati mɛn na. <verse eid="1PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16" />Kɔni ai ye a kɛ sabarini ni gbiliya rɔ. Ai ye to kɔnɔgbɛya rɔ waati bɛɛ kosa ai wa kɛ baara ɲumailu kɛla Ɲenematɔmɔnin na ko rɔ, mɔɔ mɛnilu ye ai mafɔla, woilu ye maloya ii la kumailu la. <verse eid="1PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17" />Ka a masɔrɔn ni Alla sawo le, a ka fisa mɔɔ ye tɔrɔ koɲuma kɛ diya sani a ye tɔrɔ a juuman kɛ diya. <verse eid="1PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18" />Baa Ɲenematɔmɔnin faara le an julumunilu la ko rɔ siɲa kelen haan habadan, ale mɔɔ telennin telenbaliilu yɛ, kosa a ye na ai ri Alla ma. Mɔɔilu ra a faa ten faribanku rɔ, kɔni Alla ka a lakɛndɛya, Nii Sɛniman na baraka le rɔ. <verse eid="1PE 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19" />Wo Nii Sɛniman fɛ, a wara kawandi bɔ diya nii kasola mɔɔilu yɛ, <verse eid="1PE 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20" />mɛnilu tɛrɛ ra murunti Alla ma a damira, Alla tɛrɛ ye makɔnɔla Nuhan na teleilu rɔ, a la diɲɛ rɔ, a tɛrɛ ye kulun nadanna waati mɛn na. Mɔɔ dɔndɔ le dɔrɔn kisira ji ta fan fɛla ma, wo kɔndɔ, mɔɔ seyin gbansan. <verse eid="1PE 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21" />Wo ji kɛni sun ji rɔ misali le ri ai tubi kanma mɛn ye ai fanan nakisila sisɛn. A kɛni tɛ faribanku nɔɔni bɔ fen di, kɔni dakan ta Alla yɛ kɔnɔgbɛya rɔ. Wo sun ji rɔ le ai lakisila sisɛn Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin nawuli fɛ mɛn bɔra saya rɔ, <verse eid="1PE 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22" />mɛn wani harijeene, ka a sii Alla bolokinin ma mɛlɛkailu ni setiilu ni fankamailu bɛɛ kun na.<verse eid="1PE 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4" />
  <para style="s">Dunuɲaratɛɛ kura la ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1" />Wo le rɔ, ikomin Ɲenematɔmɔnin da tɔrɔ a faribanku rɔ, ai fanan ye ai rabɛn wo hankili kelen na, ka a masɔrɔn mɛn da tɔrɔ faribanku rɔ, wo ni julumun da fara. <verse eid="1PE 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2" />Wo tii tɛ a la siimaya kɛla adamadenilu la kunfan koilu rɔ butun fo Alla sawo. <verse eid="1PE 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3" />Ka a masɔrɔn ai tɛrɛ ra mɛn lemɛniyabaliilu diyanan koilu kɛla waati taminnin dɔ, ka ai sɛɛbɛ don ko haramuninilu ni kunfan juuilu ni dɔlɔ min ni haramuya sumunilu ni dɔlɔ min sumunilu ni joo bato kɔsɔni ma. <verse eid="1PE 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4" />Wo rɔ, a ye kɛla ii latɛrɛnna ko ri baa ai tɛ ai borila ii kɔfɛ butun hankilidɔɔya ko ba siyaman ɲinilu rɔ, ka ai lafɛya. <verse eid="1PE 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5" />Kɔni ii ri ii dantɛ Alla yɛ ko wo rɔ, mɛn dabɛnni mɔɔ faaniilu ni niilamailu kiti ko la. <verse eid="1PE 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6" />Wo le rɔ, Alla la kuma Kibaro Ɲuma ra lase hali mɔɔ faaniilu ma, kosa ni ii faribanku koilu wa ban makitila ikomin adamadenilu bɛɛ, ii ye to nii lakisi rɔ Alla fɛ ka bɛn Nii Sɛniman na ko ma.<verse eid="1PE 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">An ye Alla niilifenilu labaara kosɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7" />Koilu bɛɛ laban da madon. Wo rɔ, ai ye a kɛ hankili la, ka ai jɛrɛ mira kosa ai ye se Alla matarala. <verse eid="1PE 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8" />Wo bɛɛ rɔ, ai ye sɛɛbɛ don kaninteya ma ai ɲɔɔn yɛ, ka a masɔrɔn kaninteya le julumun siyaman banna.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4.8</char> A ragbɛ Sandailu suran 10 kuma diya 12 a ni Yakuba suran 5 kuma diya 20 kɔndɔ.</note> <verse eid="1PE 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9" />Ai ɲɔɔn jiya hali ai tɛ ai makasila. <verse eid="1PE 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10" />Alla ka sɔlifen mɛn di ai kelen kelenna bɛɛ ma, ai ɲɔɔn dɛmɛn wo fanan na. Wo rɔ, ai ye kɛ le Alla la baaraden ɲumailu ri mɛnilu ye a hina suilu bɛɛ labaarala. <verse eid="1PE 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11" />Ni mɛn ka kuma ta, wo ye kuma ikomin a ye Alla la kumailu le jɛrɛ fɔla. Ni mɔɔ do ye walila doilu yɛ, a ye wali ikomin Alla ye a sɔla fanka la ɲa mɛn ma, kosa gbiliya ye di Alla ma ko bɛɛ rɔ Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin baraka rɔ. Gbiliya ni fanka ye di ale le ma habadan haan habadan. Amina.<verse eid="1PE 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tɔrɔya Isa fɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12" />N kaninteilu, tɔrɔ gbɛlɛnnin mɛn ye ai tɔrɔla, wo kana ai latɛrɛn, ikomin ko dahabali do ri ai bɔ. <verse eid="1PE 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13" />Kɔni ni ai ni Ɲenematɔmɔnin tɔrɔra an ɲɔɔn fɛ, ai ye sɛwa wo rɔ, kosa a la gbiliya wa bɔ kɛnɛma tuma mɛn na, a ni aile ye sɛwa haan. <verse eid="1PE 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14" />Ni ii ka ai nani Ɲenematɔmɔnin tɔɔ la ko rɔ, sɛwa ai yɛ wo rɔ, ka a masɔrɔn Alla la Nii Sɛniman gbiliyani ye tola ai rɔ. <verse eid="1PE 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15" />Adon, aile do si kana tɔrɔ baa ai ra kɛ mɔɔ faala ri wala son, wala kojuu kɛla, wala nafi. <verse eid="1PE 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16" />Kɔni ni ai tɔrɔra baa Isa la mɔɔ le ai ri, maloya tɛ wo rɔ, fɔɔ ai ye Alla gbiliya, baa a tɔɔ ra to ai kun na.<verse eid="1PE 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17" />Ka a masɔrɔn kiti la waati ra se, a ye damirala Alla la jama le ma. Adon, ni a ye damirala ande le ma, mɛnilu ye ii banna Alla la kuma Kibaro Ɲuma mirala woilu le laban mɔɔilu ri? <verse eid="1PE 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18" />«Ni mɔɔ telenni ri kisi dɔrɔn, Alla lɔnbaliilu ni kojuukɛlailu woilu ye tola di?»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4.18</char> Sandailu suran 11 kuma diya 31</note> <verse eid="1PE 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19" />Wo rɔ, mɛnilu tɔrɔla Alla sawo rɔ, woilu ye ii jɛrɛ sɔnɔmɛilu to ii Danni Maari bolo mɛn telenni, ii ye to ko ɲuma kɛla.<verse eid="1PE 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5" />
  <para style="s">Mɔɔbakɔrɔilu baara la jama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1" />N ye lemɛniya jama mɔɔbailu fanan madiyala ai tɛma ka a masɔrɔn n fanan kɛni jama mɔɔba do le ri ikomin iile, a ni Ɲenematɔmɔnin na tɔrɔya sereya do. Gbiliya mɛn natɔ bɔla kɛnɛma, n fanan di wo do sɔrɔn. <verse eid="1PE 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2" />Ai ye ai janto Alla la kolofen kuru rɔ, a ka mɛn karifa ai la. Ai diyagboyanin kana ii mafɛnɛ le, kɔni niilifen ɲuma ye Alla sawo rɔ. Ai kana a kɛ malobaliya koilu tɔnɔ sɔrɔn ma kɔni fo ai sɛbɛ. <verse eid="1PE 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3" />Mɛnilu karifani ai la, ai kana nɔya kɛ woilu la ikomin kuntiilu, kɔni ai ye a kɛ misali ri kuru yɛ. <verse eid="1PE 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4" />Kolofen Gbɛngbɛnna Kuntii wa bɔ kɛnɛma waati mɛn na, ai ri mansaya tɔɔmasere fula sɔrɔn gbiliya rɔ mɛn tɛ tiɲanna muumɛ.<verse eid="1PE 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5" />Kanberenilu, ai fanan ye kolo mɔɔbailu ma. Ai bɛɛ ye ai fanmajii ii yɛ ikomin faanin wa kɛ ai ɲɔɔn kan. Ka a masɔrɔn, «Alla ye a jɛrɛ wulila wasolailu kanma, kɔni a ye sɔli donna jɛrɛ majiilailu la.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">5.5</char> Sandailu suran 3 kuma diya 34</note> <verse eid="1PE 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6" />Ai ye ai majii Alla fanka kɔrɔ, kosa a ye ai mayɛlɛ a diyanan waati rɔ. <verse eid="1PE 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7" />Ai ye ai hamin koilu bɛɛ to a ma, ka a masɔrɔn a ri a janto le ai ko.<verse eid="1PE 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8" />Ai ye ai jɛrɛ mira, ka a kɛ ai hankilila, ka a masɔrɔn ai juu Ibulusa ye taamanna ikomin yara mɛn ye wurundula. A ye mɔɔilu ɲininna a ye mɛnilu dɔɔnna. <verse eid="1PE 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9" />Ai ye ai ban a rɔ, ka to lemɛniya rɔ gben. Ai ye a lɔn ko wo tɔrɔ suilu ye ai badenmailu fanan kan dunuɲa yɔrɔ bɛɛ rɔ. <verse eid="1PE 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10" />Ai wa tɔrɔ waati do rɔ, Alla hina bɛɛ tii mɛn ka ai kili habadan gbiliya rɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin dɔ, wo jɛrɛ ri ai lawuli, ka fanka di ai ma, ka ai kologbɛlɛnya, ai ma yɛrɛyɛrɛ. <verse eid="1PE 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11" />Fanka ye to ale le la habadan! Amina.<verse eid="1PE 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fo laban ni duwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12" />Silasi, n ye mɛn jatela badenma kɔnɔrɔdi ri, wo le ka n dɛmɛn bataki kundunyanin ɲin sɛbɛla ai ma, kosa n ye ai lalemɛniya, ka sereya bɔ ai yɛ, ko Alla la sɔlini tuɲa le ɲin di, ai ye mɛn dɔ gben! <verse eid="1PE 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13" />Lemɛniya jama mɛn ye Babilɔni so kɔndɔ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">5.13</char> <char style="fk">Babilɔni so</char> kɛni gbundu kuma le ri mɛn kɔrɔ ye «Romi So.» <char style="fk">N dencɛ Marika:</char> wo kɔrɔ le Piyɛri ye Marika kaninna ikomin a dencɛ. Tumado Piyɛri le Marika karanna lemɛniya ma.</note> Alla ka mɛnilu suwandi ikomin ai le, woilu ye ai tuwala. N dencɛ Marika fanan ye ai tuwala. <verse eid="1PE 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14" />Ai ye ai ɲɔɔn tuwa badenmaya sunbuli rɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 5:14">Alla ye jususuma di ai bɛɛ ma ai le mɛnilu ye Ɲenematɔmɔnin dɔ.<verse eid="1PE 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5" />
</usx>